# kubernetes-run-aggregate - Assemble a run's spec.contents, local manifests
# and generated ConfigMaps into its unsubstituted workload tree. Shared by env
# and run-platform builds, keyed on BUILD_KIND.
#
# Stops before substitution (kubernetes-run-substitute) so the pre-sub
# validation point sees the assembled tree.
#
# Outputs (env + GITHUB_OUTPUT):
#   ENVIRONMENT_NAME          - PROJECT_NAME verbatim (both kinds)
#   ENVIRONMENT_SHORT_NAME    - PROJECT_NAME without run- / run-platform-
#   ENVIRONMENT_WORKLOAD_CONTENTS_FILE - Markdown list of spec.contents for
#                               the release notes
#
# Inputs (env vars):
#   BUILD_KIND                         - Required; kubernetes-run-environment or
#                                        kubernetes-run-platform-meta-environment,
#                                        checked by load-final-kaptainpm-yaml
#   PROJECT_NAME                       - Required; must suit the kind: run-* for
#                                        an environment, run-platform-* for a
#                                        run-platform
#   TOKEN_DELIMITER_STYLE              - Env's token delimiter style (default shell)
#   TOKEN_NAME_STYLE                   - Env's token name style (default PascalCase)
#   OUTPUT_SUB_PATH                    - Build output dir (default kaptain-out)
#   MANIFESTS_SUB_PATH                 - Local env manifests dir (default src/kubernetes)
#   ENV_ALLOW_LOCAL_MANIFESTS_OVERRIDE - 'true' lets local manifests replace
#                                        colliding child files (with a warning)
#   IMAGE_BUILD_COMMAND / ENV_ENVIRONMENT_DEPLOY_BASE_IMAGE_*
#                                      - Deploy base image, read for its secret
#                                        encryption types
#   SCHEMA_VALIDATION_COMMAND          - Schema validator plugin from validate-tooling;
#                                        validates child contracts and the cleanup
#                                        policy document
#   KAPTAINPM_FILE                     - Override path for testing
#                                        (default kaptainpm/final/KaptainPM.yaml)
#
